{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cfc4kDWPCWD4jpgHQcUDd", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Flags are simple here: a TOML file holds the values, and a small helper reads them.\n\n**How it works**\n- `flags.toml` (repo root) declares every flag under `[flags]`. Right now there's only one: `invoice-pdf-v2 = false`.\n- `src/flags.py` loads that file once at import and exposes `is_on(name)`, plus `all_flags()` for listing them.\n- The project convention is to read flags only through `flags.is_on(\"name\")`, and to use kebab-case names.\n\n**For your checkout flow**\n\n1. Declare the flag in `flags.toml`:\n   ```toml\n   [flags]\n   invoice-pdf-v2 = false\n   new-checkout-flow = false\n   ```\n2. Check it where the flow branches:\n   ```python\n   from src import flags  # adjust to however the module is imported in your code\n\n   if flags.is_on(\"new-checkout-flow\"):\n       return new_checkout(...)\n   return legacy_checkout(...)\n   ```\n\n**Watch out for these**\n- **A misspelled name won't raise an error.** `is_on` returns `False` for any name missing from `flags.toml`, so a typo just leaves the new flow switched off. Copy the name exactly.\n- **Changes need a restart.** The file is read once when the module is imported, so editing `flags.toml` does nothing until the process restarts.\n- **No per-user or percentage rollout.** Each flag is on or off for everyone. If you need to enable it for some users first, you'd have to extend `flags.py`.\n\nWant me to add the flag and wire it into the checkout code?"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 421, "cache_read_input_tokens": 24942, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 421}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "a1113242-9767-45a9-a702-c8c5d9e622dc", "uuid": "dd7d1cef-74fe-435a-b2c3-9156f5c6ccc3", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T19:25:25.391Z", "request_id": "req_011Cfc4kDJUP4b1AE2AyTX8M"}
